			]
			title: "The Twilight Forest"
			x: -11.5d
			y: -19.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["73D720BAF82FD8F4"]
			description: [
				"Well, for better or worse, it worked."
				""
				"You stacked soul-infused silicates and placed the skulls atop it, and with a sickening cross between a pop and slurp the effigy disappeared.  "
				""
				"In its place, another charred bone monstrosity appears, floating a bit above the ground with a huge dose of actual explosive hatred.  It fires skulls reminiscent of the ones you harvested from the tall skeletons, and a phantom version emitting a ghostly blue light that utterly destroys anything it strikes."
				""
				"The thing renews itself slowly, knitting spine and skull back together with a dark energy.  Break it down fast, and clear the taint of malice and Undeath from the world!"
			]
			id: "2CD695FAF1E809AE"
			rewards: [
				{
