		{
			dependencies: ["7B56B7393B067482"]
			description: [
				"Concentrated malice is certainly harmful.  You aren't really sure if these skeleton are black because of charring or because they are just so incredibly saturated with evil.  The chunks of coal left behind after swiftly dismantling them is not a helpful indicator either, as this entire Realm is seems to be compased of flames and flammable things."
				""
				"One thing is certain, they can be destroyed.  "
			]
