		{
			dependencies: ["6613A6E26372A4C8"]
			description: [
				"The hoarfrost and snowdrifts play host to a tall tower, grey and cold.  Within you find ensorcelled cages spewing forth a seemingly limitless supply of undead soldiers, and four stone altars bearing indentations matching the size and shape of the little star you followed here.  "
				""
				"High above the frosty terrain, the master of the tower is conducting a ritual of some sort in this unfinished example of rudimentary architecture.  "
				"Rather than examine the effects of the ritual, interrupt it.  Destroy this undead menace and investigate the intent behind creating such a spire clawing its way to the heavens. "
				""
				"&o&7[Hint: The Night Lich flies!  Be sure to have a trusy projectile weapon at hand and perhaps a friend or other protective measure to keep the denizens of the night at bay during your skirmish!  Defeating the Night Lich unlocks access to the Aether.]"
			]
