		{
			dependencies: ["6D6B92717EF302D5"]
			description: [
				"The distant call the little stars seemed to be responding to has led you to a tower high up in the cold mountains.  It's in quite bad repair, and the feeling of malice and decay coming from it lend to the idea that something aligned with Undeath and sinister intent resides there."
				""
				"Better start climbing."
			]
