			x: -1.8d
			y: -22.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3C3428568C29E523"]
			description: [
				"The obelisk shatters after you deface one of the four panels, revealing a gigantic Gauntlet made of a metal resembling the shards you have found and the dense ores you've discovered deep in the strange reddish stone."
				""
				"This is clearly meant to be a combat trial of some sort, perhaps to test the readiness of the soldiers serving whatever kingdom once dominated this Realm."
				""
				"Unfortunately, the construct seems to only have one level of intesity for training: Lethal.  Either the aeons have worn away at the spells and etchings governing it workings, or there were some extreme examples of live-fire excercises here in the past."
				""
				"Might as well make use of it and test your abilities to make certain you are prepared to face the coming challenges!"
				""
				""
				"&o&7Hint: The Nether Gauntlet won’t take any damage unless it’s hit in the eye, which is on the front. Defeating the Nether Guantlet will unlock access to The End."
			]
