		{
			dependencies: ["62515D5060E31480"]
			description: [
				"You've seen the signs in the overworld, ancient temples in the hottest deserts bearing carvings of a spine with three skulls attached to it."
				""
				"You thought it was just a fanciful thing carved by primitive peoples, until you witnessed the unique brand of undead here in The Nether.  It's clear to you now that there was a sort of primitive worship of a thing.  This knowledge might just help you discover the nature of the entity."
				""
				"Harvest some of the soul infused sand, assemble them in the 'spine' shape from the carvings, and place three of the withered skulls atop the structure. This should provide some energy to focus through the severed skulls, summoning the dark force from it's hidden lair so you can destroy it."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:wither_skeleton_skull"
			id: "73D720BAF82FD8F4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0DFB5EB7E838199B"
