		{
			dependencies: ["253C674B4CCFA857"]
			description: [
				"An expansive tower rises above the canopy, stark and grey against the verdure of the forested Twilight Realm. Wan light illuminates the surrounding boughs with an unearthly glow, in perfect alignment with the tenebrous atmosphere ever-present in this Realm."
				""
				"This is clearly a place of importance to your quest.  Something aligned with Undeath lairs here in this place, and judging from the raw power crackling in the air, it's not a weak representative of evil."
				""
				"Climb the tower, pillage it for whatever knowledge and wealth you can find, and destroy its master."
				""
				"&o&7Hint:The Twilight Lich has an initial phase where it is shielded.  Reflecting the ender pearls it and its clones shoot at you will break the shield, moving you into position to simply beat the thing to crumbling shards of bone like you have done to so many other skeletal mostrosities."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:lich_trophy"
