		{
			dependencies: ["39767E42C2255EF1"]
			description: [
				"For the most part this Twilight Realm is tranquil and beautiful.  You do have to look past the corrupted corpses of dead druids wandering around, and mega-snakes, and the spiders, and the hungry dogs, and goblinoids, and..."
				""
				"And then you find this thing.  Deep in the maze underneath the swamp, you have encountered man-cows, charging around making noises and swinging unreasonably heavy axes at you.  But this takes the cake.  It's a Mooshroom, like any you would find on the exotic mushroom islands, but atop its foresection is the torso head and arms of one of those man-cows.  "
				""
				"Who even made this..."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:minoshroom_trophy"
