				"One must wonder if this particular story about this particular creature is some sort of universal constant.  "
				""
				"The multi-headed menace from mythology is present here in the Twilight Realm.  Stand firm against its flaming breath, and keep hacking away until it runs out of heads.  Try to return some of the delayed blast explosives it spits at you, you don't want to get hit by those and you might as well try to make use of the energy."
