		{
			dependencies: ["762C0381A3EC5E7E"]
			description: [
				"Those traders weren't kidding when they called this place magical."
				""
				"Now that you have some facility with the arcane arts, let's see if we can use some of the local materials to focus the energies of the realm into a more compact way to record our journeys here."
				""
				"Let's start by getting a feather from one of the ravens.  They've always been associated with memory and observation, perhaps the focus can be a quill of some kind.  We'll want to use the juice from some of the glowing underground berries, that seems like it will fill the need for an ink made from native sources, and the natural glow of the berries can be augmented with some glowstone dust to make the images on the map nice and bright.  Ruining your eyesight by reading in such a gloomy place simply won't do."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:magic_map"
