				"There are 'people' inhabiting these old ruins, anthrpomorphized pig-like folk.  In fact, what snippets of information you can find indicates they are called 'Piglin'.  All of them are, however, aggressive.  Some more so than others."
				""
				"The more, uh...normal, Piglins are easily fooled into believing you are aligned with them by taking advantage of their very obvious obsession with gold.  Wearing a bit of highly impractical golden armor will convince them you are no threat whatsoever to their people.  You've also discovered that accidentally dropping some gold bars on the ground near them causes them to chase it down, pick it up, and accidentally drop something they were carrying for you to pick up."
				""
				"I suppose this technically counts as trading..."
			]
